// AREA isles: the Sunport Battle Tower, open at the weekend. Every win adds
// to this week's streak; a loss ends it. The weekly quest islesTowerWeek asks
// for three in a row.

## The tower floor

::bg{location="sunport-tower" time="day"}
@sunportTowerClerk: Challenger {{userName}}, win streak {{run.islesTowerStreak}}. Your opponent is ready.
::use{component="trainerBattle" who="sunportAceKestrel" intro="Another Champion. The tower has had a few." win="Good. Again next week." lose="The tower keeps its record." prize="1200"}
::set{run.islesTowerStreak += 1 when="@wonFight"}
::set{run.islesTowerStreak = 0 when="!@wonFight"}
@sunportTowerClerk{when="@wonFight"}: Streak: {{run.islesTowerStreak:plural(# win|# wins)}}.
@sunportTowerClerk{when="!@wonFight"}: The streak ends there. Come back and start another.
